{"data": [{"author_id": "982939260", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:07:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114841269188846045"], "id": "2114841269188846045", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 5503, "like_count": 108, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 20}, "text": "Here's a very crude simplified chutes roadmap/plan, for near term:\n- move the most unprofitable things off of the subnet, including today's announcement of some (not all) additional inference options (not paid via emissions)\n- this allows us to scale the things we want and need", "url": "https://x.com/jon_durbin/status/2114841269188846045"}, {"author_id": "2252943488", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:04:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114840687426330726"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/benjamindekr/s…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/benjamindekr/status/2114763634501124489", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/RAK0R6nEF0"}]}, "id": "2114840687426330726", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 838, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114763634501124489", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "To all the “anti-datacenter!” people, data centers hosting and training open source AI is exposing how your corporate overlords and bad actors can spy on you regularly.\n\nYou should be more angry about the invasion of privacy than the proliferation of AI capable of finding this. https://t.co/RAK0R6nEF0", "url": "https://x.com/DeeperThrill/status/2114840687426330726"}, {"author_id": "2112384971243417602", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:06:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114856119411896475", "2114856278962880771"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 38, "start": 33, "tag": "CRWV"}]}, "id": "2114856278962880771", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "tex